          "type": "table"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "Table_1_01!A57",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Coal includes anthracite, bituminous, subbituminous, lignite, and waste coal; synthetic coal and refined coal; and beginning in 2011, coal-derived synthesis gas. Prior to 2011 coal-derived synthesis gas was included in Other Fossil Gas.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "type": "line_break"
            },
            {
              "text": "Petroleum Liquids includes distillate and residual fuel oils, jet fuel, kerosene, waste oil, and beginning in 2011, propane. Prior to 2011 propane was included in Other Fossil Gas.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "type": "line_break"
            },
            {
              "text": "Petroleum Coke includes petroleum coke-derived synthesis gas. Prior to 2011, petroleum coke-derived synthesis gas was included in Other Fossil Gas.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "type": "line_break"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other Fossil Gas includes gaseous propane, blast furnace gas, other manufactured and waste gases derived from fossil fuels other than hydrogen.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "type": "line_break"
            },
            {
              "text": "See the Technical Notes for fuel conversion factors.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "type": "line_break"
            },
            {
              "text": "Renewable Sources include wood, black liquor, other wood waste, biogenic municipal solid waste, landfill gas, sludge waste, agriculture byproducts, other biomass, geothermal, solar thermal, photovoltaic energy, and wind.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "type": "line_break"
            },
            "<17 more items>"
          ],
          "role": "note",
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "kind": "sheet",
      "title": "Table_1_01",
      "type": "section"
    }
